    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>“Your forge does not make weapons—your forge makes endings.”</em></p><p>As an <strong>action</strong>, you can raise the <strong>Final Push Standard</strong>, a spectral or physical banner that anchors a desperate charge or last stand.</p><ul><li>You create a <strong>6 squares-radius aura</strong> centered on you that lasts for <strong>1 minute</strong> and moves with you.</li><li>Allies in the aura gain a <strong>+2 bonus</strong> to attack rolls and defense check.</li><li>At the start of each of their turns while in the aura, allies gain <strong>temporary Integrity equal to your tier</strong>.</li><li>When an ally in the aura reduces a creature to 0 Integrity or forces a surrender, they can immediately move up to <strong>2 squares</strong> without provoking opportunity attacks.</li><li>Enemies in the aura have <strong>disadvantage</strong> on defense check against being <strong>Shaken</strong>.</li></ul><p>You can use this feature once per <strong>a Soma Break</strong>.</p><p><strong>OP Echo.</strong> If a battle, siege, or parley ends decisively in your faction’s favor while the banner is active, your faction gains <strong>+1 Unity OP</strong> and <strong>+1 Diplomacy or Soft Power OP</strong> (your choice) for the next strategic turn.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
